flowchart TD
  start["Operator saves a request and explicitly runs the manual flow"]
  start --> n0["Record source/version/hash, explicit freshness and recipient evidence in Follow-up Contexts; keep source due and agreed target dates separate"]
  n0 --> n1["Create a Record follow-up request with current context version, new event identity, completed predecessor, stage/state, UTC time, rationale and next action"]
  n1 --> n2["Run the on-demand flow with the saved numeric request ID; inspect that exact terminal run and completion marker"]
  n2 --> n3["Inspect immutable history and native versions; append a new transition rather than editing prior events"]
  n3 --> n4["Create a Preview digest request with UTC as-of and optional previous completed preview key, then run it"]
  n4 --> n5["Use the exact RunKey-filtered candidate, exception and suppression rows; inspect stage-entry, human priority, accepted role and separate dates"]
  n5 --> n6["Reconcile unknown scope/ownership/freshness/recipient evidence; retain closed and unchanged results without notifications"]
  n6 --> n7["Preserve edits and partial outputs; exact retries reuse unchanged records, while conflicts hold the operation"]
  n7 --> n8["Use isolated copied-record recovery and source/copy mappings before any separately qualified live cutover"]
  n8 --> n9["Continue version-bound annotations and advisory review criteria; these records do not decide clinical content"]
  n9 --> output["Versioned native history and completed digest snapshots in SharePoint; delivery disabled"]
  start -. "Missing, stale or conflicting evidence" .-> hold["Hold affected operation; preserve evidence; reconcile before retry"]
